nd where he's  agreed to operate as a sleeper agent for  dracula in exchange for a carbonadium  synthesizer so  for our plan of using omega red's  carbonadium implants against him we're  going to have to either steal  or neutralize the synthesizer then we  have the added obstacle of omega red  being on krakoa where mutants are  resurrected  after their deaths however if we're able  to convince the mutants that omega red  was in fact a spy  i doubt they would be too keen to  resurrect him and that's the way that we  do this  either we use the muramasa blade or  failing that we find a way to intensify  the toxic effects of the carbonadium in  his body and then in turn we just keep  the mutant population from resurrecting  him from the dead and then he just stays  dead forever but if you guys have a  better way  let me know in the comments and let me  know what other characters that we  should try to get rid of in this series  because i kind of like the idea of  bringing it back but if you guys are new  here to comments explain make sure you  guys hit the sub button to become part  of the rob core if you guys enjoyed this  video make sure you drop a like and i  will catch you all later  peace  [Music]  [Music]  um  [Music]  you

